{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17278","headline":"送韦行军员外赴河阳 · 权德舆","name":"送韦行军员外赴河阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五代武弁侍明光，辍佐中权拜外郎。\n记事还同楚倚相，传经远自汉扶阳。\n离堂处处罗簪组，东望河桥壮鼙鼓。\n三城晓角啓轩门，一县繁花照莲府。\n上略儒风并者稀，翩翩驺骑有光辉。\n只今右职多虚位，应待他时伏奏归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17278.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17278","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}